Z||000000||Jhonny||11-22-2000||02:15 AM||||Hi all,<P>Can someone tell me if there is a parts cross reference list to be found that<BR>shows what engine parts are used on other<BR>GM cars as well ? (sensors,ignition components etc)<BR>I have a 2.8L -87 Fiero GT and these cars are<BR>not that common here in Sweden so a cross reference would help.<BR>Other GM cars with the 2.8L V6 are more common over here.<P>Thanks<P>Jhonny<P><P>------------------<BR>Jhonny Sokura<BR>Vadstena, Östergötland Sweden<BR><A HREF="http://www.vadstena.se/turism/engelsk/index.html" TARGET=_blank> Welcome to Vadstena</A>||||reg||5
Z||000001||theogre||11-22-2000||02:19 PM||||A start would be the book used by most scrap yards to cross ref. I don't know who publishes these. I see them at most yards here. I imagin the yards there can get them.<P>Other things don't have direct cross ref so there is no book listing. For example you can use a EGR solinoid off other cars but you may have to use the other car's harness connector and maybe it's bracket. It will work just fine but because it's not a direct drop in it's not considered as a cross ref.||||reg||1
